{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-park-villas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"park-villas","about":"Welcome to The Park Villas by Damac. Choose from the spaciously crafted 3 and 4 bedroom luxurious homes within Damac Hills. It is perfect for the idyllic family lifestyle with a myriad of outdoor activities to fill the time. Not just that, you also have access to the lagoon-style swimming pool, the skating park, volleyball courts, basketball courts and tennis courts. Amenities also include dedicated children’s play areas, jogging tracks, and outdoor fitness centres.If you are a golf enthusiast, Damac Hills has got you covered with the amazing Trump International Golf Club. As a resident of The Park Villas, you will be living close to the beach, and the Mall of Emirates. You will also be just minutes away from the Dubai International Airport, Dubai Marina, and Business Bay. If you are looking for the perfect active and tranquil family life, choose The Park Villas at Damac Hills.","price":3082000,"title":"Park Villas","bitrix":{"id":283,"pf_id":"are.2.1022","source":null,"project_id":"Park Villas","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Park Villas","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"DAMAC Properties","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/park_villas_feature_3cc4966818.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/park_villas_feature_3cc4966818.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.02169265,"lng":55.2535990151426},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/park_villas_3_a4b780eab4.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/park_villas_3_a4b780eab4.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/park_villas_1_f0c7cba8b2.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/pa